ogression-free survival; IFN, interferon alpha-2a.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="btt-2-517f3"/></fig><fig id="f4-btt-2-517" position="float"><label>Figure 4</label><caption><p>Bevacizumab is a good partner for combination therapy.</p><p><bold>Abbreviations:</bold> NK, not known; IFN, interferon alpha-2a.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="btt-2-517f4"/></fig><table-wrap id="t1-btt-2-517" position="float"><label>Table 1</label><caption><p>Summary of the adverse events for sunitinib and bevacizumab plus IFN</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">All grade (%)</th><th align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Sunitinib</th><th align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Bevacizumab plus IFN</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Fatigue</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">51</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">33</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Diarrhea</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">53</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">20</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Nausea</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">44</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">NR</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Stomatitis</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">25</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02013;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Hand-foot syndrome</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">20</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02013;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Hypertension</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">24</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">26</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Bleeding</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">12</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">33</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Thrombocytopenia</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">65</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">6</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Anemia</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">71</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">10</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Proteinuria</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02013;</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">18</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tfn1-btt-2-517" fn-type="abbr"><p><bold>Abbreviation:</bold> IFN, interferon alpha-2a; NR, not reported.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-group></article>